TALLY_FINAL_MESSAGE={"authorizedComments":[{"author":"uid:1000","body":"OVERSEER ADVISORY (arm-time): (1) A warm local wheel cache exists at /home/tom/.cache/flashnext-wheels/ on the coordinator with torch-2.13.0+rocm7.14.0, torchvision-0.28.0+rocm7.14.0, and triton-3.6.0+rocm7.14.0 cp312 linux_x86_64 wheels pre-downloaded from the vendor index. Your Containerfile must still reference https://repo.amd.com/rocm/whl-multi-arch/ (the acceptance grep requires it), but build.sh may bind-mount the cache dir and pass --find-links to pip so the multi-GB torch wheel is not re-downloaded at image build. (2) ubuntu:24.04 base image is already pulled locally via podman. (3) Do not add torchaudio — drop audio extras (the goal text is authoritative). (4) The build must ride ethernet (default route); never touch a 10.99.0.x address.","createdAt":"2026-08-29T06:09:35.472Z","id":2,"updatedAt":"2026-08-29T06:09:35.472Z","url":"local://campaign/01a04c1f-4605-7823-9eac-475e99b842ae/steering/2"},{"author":"uid:1000","body":"OVERSEER (post-failure insurance, applies to any future attempt): the previous attempt did all the work — authored container/, ran the full 64-minute build, wrote the receipt — then exited WITHOUT committing, and the driver failed it at ownership validation (\"agent left uncommitted changes; commit the task before ownership validation\"). Your final acts, in order, MUST be: (1) run the acceptance argv yourself and see it pass; (2) git add ONLY paths inside your conflict domains (container/, results/receipts/); (3) git commit with a descriptive message; (4) verify `git status --porcelain` is empty before you finish. Note the flashnext:dev image and its layers already exist in podman storage from the prior attempt — a re-run of build.sh should be fast via layer cache; do not prune or rebuild from scratch.","createdAt":"2026-08-29T07:11:19.614Z","id":4,"updatedAt":"2026-08-29T07:11:19.614Z","url":"local://campaign/01a04c1f-4605-7823-9eac-475e99b842ae/steering/4"}],"receipt":{"lateRecheckCommentIds":[2,4],"preparedCommentIds":[],"recheckTruncated":false,"rechecked":true,"source":{"kind":"local-jsonl","path":"/home/tom/.local/state/tally/campaigns/steering/01a04c1f-4605-7823-9eac-475e99b842ae/steering-v1.jsonl","preparedCursor":1,"recheckedCursor":4,"registrationId":"01a04c1f-4605-7823-9eac-475e99b842ae"}},"taskId":"container-recipe"}
